l One Financial 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] Capital One 的 Discover Deal 盈利能力“現在可見”，每股收益達到 6.69 美元，信用卡沖銷下降 65 個基點"},{"title":"OCC Finds Nine Largest US Banks Debanked Customers Over Politics and Religion","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE4yZTBRM2NkcDFsZnRoS0pBMlpXOUdqSUltNWQwYnFTaG1LWjB0bHNEVDY0N1dVUGxHUXZIeFM2YThoMDg3dEJYcHE1cnpiTmhINnRHRzh2N3M2ZHA4N0g3aEs3S3FHYzNmcjFCTTlQRmwxOXBkSkE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"OCC 發現美國九大銀行因政治和宗教原因取消了客戶的銀行帳戶"},{"title":"CoreWeave Bets on Trillions in Insurance Capital as Near-15% Bond Yields Expose High-Leverage Risks","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBuZEZaUVdESVJWR3d5a3N5SmlQQkNGWktyZHpIck85UTF2LWU2aHpmbTQweU9QTzRqVDJoM2p5alRSVUpoWjd1b2YyQmoxYTA1S0RBbWxZaWYxem5LbkVpUzYzV1M5LTZrOHJJcjd2cHo2cUo2U1E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/927628/000092762826000024/cof-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Capital One Financial Corporation, a Delaware corporation established in 1994 and headquartered in McLean, Virginia, is a diversified financial services holding company with banking and non-banking subsidiaries. Capital One Financial Corporation and its subsidiaries (the \"Company\" or \"Capital One\") operate as a global payments provider and diversified financial institution, delivering a broad array of financial products and services to consumers, small businesses and commercial clients through digital channels, branch locations, caf s and other distribution channels.","zh":"第一資本金融公司是一家特拉華州公司，成立於 1994 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州麥克萊恩，是一家多元化的金融服務控股公司，擁有銀行和非銀行子公司。第一資本金融公司及其子公司（「公司」或「第一資本」）作為全球支付提供者和多元化金融機構運營，透過數位管道、分支機構、咖啡館和其他分銷管道向消費者、小型企業和商業客戶提供廣泛的金融產品和服務。"},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, Capital One Financial Corporation's principal operating subsidiary was Capital One, National Association (\"CONA\"). On May 18, 2025 (the \"Closing Date\"), Discover Financial Services (\"Discover\") merged into Capital One and Discover Bank merged into CONA. See \"Part II—Item 8. Financial Statements and Supplementary Data—Note 2—Business Combinations and Discontinued Operations\" for additional information. The Company is hereafter collectively referred to as \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our.\" CONA is referred to as the \"Bank.\"","zh":"As of December 31, 2025, Capital One Financial Corporation's principal operating subsidiary was Capital One, National Association (\"CONA\"). 2025 年 5 月 18 日（「截止日期」），Discover Financial Services（「Discover」）併入第一資本，Discover Bank 併入第一資本。有關更多資訊，請參閱“第二部分——第 8 項。財務報表和補充數據——註釋 2——業務合併和終止經營”。 The Company is hereafter collectively referred to as \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our.\" CONA 被稱為「銀行」。"},{"en":"References to \"this Report\" or our \"2025 Form 10-K\" or \"2025 Annual Report\" are to our Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2025. All references to 2025, 2024 and 2023, refer to our fiscal years ended, or the dates, as the context requires, December 31, 2025, December 31, 2024 and December 31, 2023, respectively. Certain business terms used in this document are defined in \"Part II—Item 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations (\"MD&A\")—Glossary and Acronyms\" and should be read in conjunction with the Consolidated Financial Statements included in this Report.","zh":"提及「本報告」或我們的「2025 年 10-K 表格」或「2025 年年度報告」是指我們截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的財政年度的 10-K 表格年度報告。所有提及 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年的內容均指我們結束的財政年度或日期（視上下文而定），2025 年 12 月 31 日、2024 年 12 月 31 日和分別為2023年12月31日。本文件中使用的某些業務術語在「第二部分 - 第 7 項。管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論和分析 (“MD&A”) - 術語表和縮略語”中進行了定義，並應與本報告中包含的合併財務報表結合起來閱讀。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Each of our business segments operates in a highly competitive environment, and we face competition in all aspects of our business from numerous bank and non-bank providers of financial services.","zh":"我們的每個業務部門都在競爭激烈的環境中運營，我們在業務的各個方面都面臨著來自眾多銀行和非銀行金融服務提供者的競爭。"},{"en":"Our Credit Card business competes with international, national, regional and local issuers of Visa and Mastercard credit cards, as well as with American Express , private-label card brands and, to a certain extent, issuers of debit cards. In general, customers are attracted to credit card issuers largely on the basis of price, credit limit, reward programs, customer experience and other product features.","zh":"我們的信用卡業務與 Visa 和 Mastercard 信用卡的國際、國家、地區和本地發行商以及美國運通、自有品牌卡品牌以及在一定程度上的借記卡發行商競爭。一般來說，信用卡發行商吸引客戶主要是基於價格、信用額度、獎勵計劃、客戶體驗和其他產品功能。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Credit Card","val":39560000000,"zh":"Credit Card"},{"name":"Consumer Banking","val":10433000000,"zh":"Consumer Banking"},{"name":"Commercial Banking","val":3655000000,"zh":"Commercial Banking"}],"total":53434000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Interchange Fees Contracts","val":6443000000,"zh":"Interchange Fees Contracts"},{"name":"Service Charges & Other Customer Fees Contracts","val":857000000,"zh":"服務費和其他客戶費用合約"},{"name":"Other Contract Revenue","val":762000000,"zh":"Other Contract Revenue"}],"total":53434000000}},"peers":["BNY","PNC","MS","AXP","USB"]}}